not_connected.description:
Charger {serial} has not come to Home Assistant within 10 minutes. Check:
• the Wi-Fi icon is on the charger screen (if not — the name or password is wrong, or the network is 5 GHz only);
• OCPP is switched on in Settings → Wi-Fi;
• Home Assistant is reachable at {url} from your network.

You can add the charger anyway — it will appear as soon as it connects.
